    "aliases": [],
    "summary": "",
    "description": "CHOGORIAN WARBAND\n[AUXILIARY DETACHMENT]\n\n- Fast Attack Slots in this Detachment may only be used to select Scimitar Jetbike Squadron Units.\n- Recon Slots in this Detachment may only be used to select Outrider Squadron Units.\n\nVIth LEGIONES ASTARTES",
