    "description": "Any Model with the Space Wolves Trait may have its chainsword exchanged for one Fenrisian axe for +2 Points per Model.\n\n**Melee Weapon**\n\n**Melee Weapon**\n\n**IM**\n\n**AM**\n\n**SM**\n\n**AP**\n\n**D**\n\n**Special Rules**\n\n**Traits**\n\nFenrisian axe\n\nFenrisian axe\nI\n\nA\n\n+1\n\n-\n\n1\n\nReaping Blow (1)\n\nNone",
