    "name": "Inferno Pistol",
    "aliases": [],
    "summary": "",
    "description": "Any Model with the Blood Angels Trait may have its plasma pistol exchanged for one inferno pistol for +5 Points per Model.\n\n**Ranged Weapon**\n\n**Ranged Weapon**\n\n**R**\n\n**FP**\n\n**RS**\n\n**AP**\n\n**D**\n\n**Special Rules**\n\n**Traits**\n\nInferno Pistol\n\nInferno pistol\n6\n\n1\n\n8\n\n2\n\n1\n\nPistol, Melta (3)\n\nAssault, Melta",
