    "name": "Revelation Host",
    "aliases": [],
    "summary": "",
    "description": "REVELATION HOST\n[AUXILIARY DETACHMENT]\n\n- Troops Slots in this Detachment may only be used to select Assault Squad Units. Elites Slots in this Detachment may only be used to select Dawnbreaker Cohort Units or Veteran Assault Squad Units.\n\nXth LEGIONES ASTARTES",
