    "description": "Any Model with the Command, Champion or Sergeant Sub-Type and the Ultramarines Trait may have its power axe exchanged for one Legatine axe for +5 Points per Model.\n\n**Melee Weapon**\n\n**Melee Weapon**\n\n**IM**\n\n**AM**\n\n**SM**\n\n**AP**\n\n**D**\n\n**Special Rules**\n\n**Traits**\n\nLegatine axe\n\nLegatine axe\nI\n\nA\n\n+1\n\n3\n\n1\n\nBreaching (4+)\n\nPower",
