    "description": "Any Model with the Command, Champion, Specialist or Sergeant Sub-Type and the Salamanders Trait may have their power weapon exchanged for one of the following for +5 Points per Model:\n\n**Melee Weapon**\n\n**Melee Weapon**\n\n**IM**\n\n**AM**\n\n**SM**\n\n**AP**\n\n**D**\n\n**Special Rules**\n\n**Traits**\n\nForge-crafted power sword\n\nForge-crafted power sword\nI\n\n+1\n\nS\n\n3\n\n1\n\nBreaching (6+)\n\nPower\n\nForge-crafted power axe\n\nForge-crafted power axe\n-1\n\n+1\n\n+1\n\n3\n\n1\n\nBreaching (5+)\n\nPower\n\nForge-crafted power maul\n\nForge-crafted power maul\n-1\n\n+1\n\n+2\n\n3\n\n1\n\nBreaching (6+)\n\nPower\n\nForge-crafted power lance\n\nForge-crafted power lance\n+1\n\n+1\n\nS\n\n3\n\n1\n\nPrecision (6+)\n\nPower",
