    "summary": "",
    "description": "The Controlling Player of any Units that include only Models with the Salamanders Trait can spend Reaction Points to make the following Advanced Reaction:\n\n**Covers:**\n- Selfless Burden",
    "source": "Legiones Astartes army list",
    "gameSystem": "horus-heresy-3e",
    "kind": "reaction",
    "context": "Legiones Astartes > Rite of War: Legiones Astartes Salamanders",
