    "name": "Atramentar",
    "aliases": [],
    "summary": "",
    "description": "If a Centurion in Terminator Armour, Cataphractii Command Squad, Tartaros Command Squad, Cataphractii Terminator Squad or Tartaros Terminator Squad Unit that has the Night Lords Trait is selected to fill a Prime Force Organisation Slot, the following Prime Advantage can be selected:\n\nAtramentar\nModels in a Unit selected to fill a Prime Force Organisation Slot with this Prime Advantage gain the Deep Strike and Impact (I) Special Rules.",
