    "description": "ATRAMENTAR HUNT\n[APEX DETACHMENT]\n\n- Retinue Slots in this Detachment must be filled with Cataphractii Command Squad Units or Tartaros Command Squad Units.\n- Heavy Assault Slots in this Detachment must be filled with Cataphractii Terminator Squad Units or Tartaros Terminator Squad Units.\n- The only Prime Advantage that can be selected for Battlefield Role Slots in this Detachment is the Atramentar Prime Advantage.\n\nXIIth LEGIONES ASTARTES",
