    "description": "Any Model with the Command, Champion, Specialist or Sergeant Sub-Type may have its power weapon exchanged for one power scythe for +10 Points per Model or its power fist exchanged for one power scythe for +5 Points.\n\n**Melee Weapon**\n\n**Melee Weapon**\n\n**IM**\n\n**AM**\n\n**SM**\n\n**AP**\n\n**D**\n\n**Special Rules**\n\n**Traits**\n\nPower scythe\n\nPower scythe\n-1\n\nA\n\n+1\n\n3\n\n1\n\nReaping Blow (2), Breaching (5+)\n\nPower",
