    "description": "All Models in a Unit with the Corvidae Prosperine Arcana gain the following benefits:\n\n- The Fated Shots Psychic Power\n- The Paths of Consequence Psychic Power\n- The ‘Corvidae’ Trait\n\n**Covers:**\n- Fated Shots\n- Paths of Consequence",
