    "description": "(Psychic Weapon)\n\n**Ranged Weapon**\n\n**Ranged Weapon**\n\n**R**\n\n**FP**\n\n**RS**\n\n**AP**\n\n**D**\n\n**Special Rules**\n\n**Traits**\n\nEmanation of Dread\n\nEmanation of Dread\n24\n\n3\n\n4\n\n-\n\n1\n\nPanic (1)\n\nPsychic",
