    "aliases": [],
    "summary": "",
    "description": "(Psychic Power, Blessing)\n\nThis Psychic Power can be used in the Start Phase to restore a single Wound to a Unit.\n\n**Trigger:** The Active Player may choose to Manifest the Machine Empathy Psychic Power in the Effects Sub-Phase of the Start Phase.\n\n**Focus:** The Focus of the Power must be a Model with the Osiraean Trait and under the Active Player’s control.\n\n**Target:** The Target Model must be a single Model in the Unit that the Focus is part of.\n\n**Duration:** If successfully Manifested, the effects of this Psychic Power are resolved immediately.\n\n**Process**\n\n- Once the Focus and Target Unit have been decided, the Controlling Player of the Focus must make a Manifestation Check.\n- If the Manifestation Check is successful, then the Target Model gains 1 Wound. This cannot increase the Target Model’s Wounds Characteristic above its Base Value.\n- If the Manifestation Check fails then there is no further effect.\n\nXVIth LEGIONES ASTARTES",
