    "summary": "",
    "description": "Any Model with the Alpha Legion Trait and the Command or Champion Sub-Type may be given venom spheres for +5 Points per Model.\n\n**Ranged Weapon**\n\n**Ranged Weapon**\n\n**R**\n\n**FP**\n\n**RS**\n\n**AP**\n\n**D**\n\n**Special Rules**\n\n**Traits**\n\nVenom Spheres\n\nVenom spheres\n8\n\n1\n\n1\n\n-\n\n1\n\nBlast (3\"), Poisoned (4+)\n\nAssault",
