    "aliases": [],
    "summary": "Ranged Weapon",
    "description": "**Ranged Weapon**\n\n**Ranged Weapon**\n\n**R**\n\n**FP**\n\n**RS**\n\n**AP**\n\n**D**\n\n**Special Rules**\n\n**Traits**\n\nWarp Torrent\n\nWarp Torrent\n\n- Torrent\n\n- Torrent\n12\n\n4\n\n5\n\n4\n\n1\n\nDeflagrate (5), Overload (1), Force (FP)\n\nAssault\n\n- Malignant\n\n- Malignant\n12\n\n1\n\n5\n\n2\n\n2\n\nDeflagrate (5), Overload (2), Force (RS)\n\nAssault",
