    "description": "**Augury scanners allow attacks to ignore Shrouded Damage Mitigation Tests.**\n\nWhen a Shooting Attack made by a Unit that includes any Models with an augury scanner inflicts any Hits (excluding Hits from attacks made as Snap Shots), Shrouded Damage Mitigation Rolls cannot be made against those Hits.",
