    "summary": "Cortex controllers allow Automata to make Reactions.",
    "description": "**Cortex controllers allow Automata to make Reactions.**\n\nA Unit that includes any Models with the Automata Type can ignore the restriction on making Reactions imposed by the Automata Type while it includes one or more Models with a cortex controller.",
    "source": "Legiones Astartes army list",
