    "summary": "Cyber-familiars grant a bonus to Intelligence Checks.",
    "description": "**Cyber-familiars grant a bonus to Intelligence Checks.**\n\nThe Controlling Player of a Model with a cyber-familiar can modify the results of Intelligence Checks made for that Model by -2.",
    "source": "Legiones Astartes army list",
