    "name": "Dozer Blade",
    "aliases": [],
    "summary": "Dozer blades allow Models to ignore the Movement penalties of Difficult Terrain.",
    "description": "**Dozer blades allow Models to ignore the Movement penalties of Difficult Terrain.**\n\nIf the Controlling Player chooses for a Model with a dozer blade to enter any area of Difficult Terrain, the Unit does not apply a modifier to its movement during that Phase.",
    "source": "Legiones Astartes army list",
