    "summary": "When not attacking Titans, Knights or Super-heavies, a Weapon with this Special Rule must make Snap Shots.",
    "description": "**When not attacking Titans, Knights or Super-heavies, a Weapon with this Special Rule must make Snap Shots.**\n\nIf the target of a Shooting Attack is not a Unit entirely composed of Models with the Titan, Knight or Super-heavy Sub-Type or other Models with a Base Wounds Characteristic of 10 or more, then all attacks made for a Weapon with this Special Rule must be made as Snap Shots.",
