    "aliases": [],
    "summary": "An Auxilia vexilla increases the Casualty threshold when making Panic Checks for a Unit in the Shooting Phase from 25% to 50%.",
    "description": "**An Auxilia vexilla increases the Casualty threshold when making Panic Checks for a Unit in the Shooting Phase from 25% to 50%.**\n\nWhen determining whether a Unit containing at least one Model with an Auxilia vexilla is required to take a Leadership Check in the Morale Sub-Phase of the Shooting Phase due to the number of Models removed from that Unit as Casualties, a Check only has to be made for the Unit if the number of Models removed is equal to 50% or more of the total number of Models in the Unit at the start of that Shooting Attack.",
    "source": "Solar Auxilia army list",
