    "summary": "",
    "description": "While a Model with the Solar Auxilia Trait is engaged in a Challenge, its Controlling Player may select the following Gambit:\n\n**Covers:**\n- Contemptuous Volley",
    "source": "Solar Auxilia army list",
    "gameSystem": "horus-heresy-3e",
    "kind": "army rule",
    "context": "Solar Auxilia",
