    "summary": "Assault shields grant a variable Invulnerable Save, the Shield Trait and the Heavy Sub-Type.",
    "description": "**Assault shields grant a variable Invulnerable Save, the Shield Trait and the Heavy Sub-Type.**\n\nA Model with an assault shield gains a 6+ Invulnerable Save that is modified to 5+ against attacks made as part of a Volley Attack or Overwatch Reaction. In addition it gains the Shield Trait and the Heavy Sub-Type.",
