    "summary": "",
    "description": "These Cybertheurgic Rites are available to any Model with both the Cybertheurgist and Mechanicum Traits.\n\n**Covers:**\n- Cybertheurgic Rite: Programming Interrupt\n- Cybertheurgic Rite: Cogitator Purge\n- Cybertheurgic Rite: Overcharged Reactors",
    "source": "Mechanicum (Forces of the Taghmata) army list",
