    "summary": "",
    "description": "These Cybertheurgic Rites are available to Cybertheurgists of the Lacrymaerta Sub-faction.\n\n**Covers:**\n- Cybertheurgic Rite: Omega Protocols\n- Cybertheurgic Rite: Flesh-knit Protocols",
