    "summary": "",
    "description": "The Fury of Ages Cybertheurgic Rite is available to Cybertheurgists of the Myrmidax Sub-faction, while the Chastise the Machine Spirit Cybertheurgic Rite is available to Cybertheurgists of any Mechanicum Sub-faction.\n\n**Covers:**\n- Cybertheurgic Rite: Fury of Ages\n- Cybertheurgic Rite: Chastise the Machine Spirit",
    "source": "Mechanicum (Forces of the Taghmata) army list",
