    "summary": "",
    "description": "The following comprises a listing of the warriors and war machines of the Anathema Psykana, the Silent Sisterhood whose warriors enforced the Great Tithe throughout the Imperium. It includes Army List Profiles for the core of the Silent Sisterhood, allowing players to build and field Anathema Psykana armies.\n\nThe Rules found in this book are used in conjunction with the Rules for Armies in the Age of Darkness. The Rules describe the process of creating an Army, while the additional Rules that follow provide Unit Profiles for Armies of the Anathema Psykana.\n\n**Covers:**\n- ‘Core’ and ‘Expanded’ Army List Profiles\n- The Anathema Psykana at War: Building a Sisters of Silence Army\n- Additional Reaction Point",
