    "summary": "A mag-inverter shield reduces the distance moved by enemy Units that Charge.",
    "description": "**A mag-inverter shield reduces the distance moved by enemy Units that Charge.**\n\nA Model with a mag-inverter shield gains the Shield Trait. If a Unit that includes a majority of Models that have mag-inverter shields is the target of a Charge, reduce the distance moved by the Charging Unit by 1\", to a minimum of 1\".",
    "source": "Legio Titanicus army list",
