    "description": "Add one additional Support Force Organisation Slot to the Detachment that includes the Prime Slot with this Prime Advantage. This Force Organisation Slot may only be filled by a Unit selected from the Cults Abominatio Army List. This Prime Advantage may only be selected for a single Force Organisation Slot in an Army’s Primary Detachment.",
